ign="left" valign="top" charoff="50">24</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">47&#x000b1;1.3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">34&#x000b1;1.1<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">18&#x000b1;0.2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.9&#x000b1;0.37</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">48</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">39&#x000b1;1.7</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">44&#x000b1;1.7<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">17&#x000b1;0.9</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.1&#x000b1;0.20</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t1-fn1"><label/><p>Cell cycle distribution G0/G1, S, G2/M and subG0/G1 in &#x00025;.</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn2"><label/><p><sup>&#x0002a;</sup>Statistical significance <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.005 for cells at S phase (24 and 48&#x02009;h) <italic>vs</italic> control (0&#x02009;h) from three experiments.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>